</section><section class="band band-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Let's make your reports work harder</h2>
    <p class="lede">Tell us which report is falling short. We'll review it with you and recommend the fixes.</p>
    <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a Session</a></p>
  </div>
</section></article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
